Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanIndustrialIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Rusty industrial bridge structure obstructing view" .

:weather1 a :DayCondition, :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Obstructed view due to rusty bridge structure" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Potential lane intrusion due to unclear road markings under bridge" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Distraction risk from unusual industrial structure" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black sedan driving under bridge" .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.50"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

